flowchart LR
    A["Search Results<br/>(Title + Snippet)"] --> B["Relevance Filter<br/>(Content-word overlap)"]
    B --> C["Claim Normalization<br/>(Extract atomic claims)"]
    C --> D{"Any relevant<br/>snippets?"}
    D -- Yes --> E["Pass to EvidenceAggregator<br/>(NLI comparison)"]
    D -- No --> F["NO_RELEVANT_RESULTS<br/>(Return to user)"]
